  "goodToKnow": "Die Schale is a shell, peel or skin (Eierschale, Kartoffelschale, Orangenschale) and a bowl: eine Schale Obst. The idiom sich in Schale werfen means to dress up. In Vienna cafés, a Schale Gold can be a coffee with milk, and in Austria, a Schale is also a cup of coffee. The verb is schälen (to peel), and die Muschelschale is a seashell."
